<title>LATVIA: AKTA Q1 LOSS 66,563 LATS.</title>
<headline>AKTA Q1 LOSS 66,563 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Akta made a loss of 66,563 lats in the first quarter of 1997 on turnover of 171,275 lats, the stock exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>The company also made a gross loss of 47,272 lats after production costs of 218,547 lats, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>It had distribution costs of 15,946 lats and adminstrative costs of 5,598 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
